Thanks,
For future references, I finally get it to work as follows:
cur_warn = getOption("warn");
options(warn=-1)
suppressPackageStartupMessages(library(foreach,quietly=TRUE));
suppressPackageStartupMessages(library(doSNOW,quietly=TRUE));
options(warn=cur_warn);

